OL,3,GNEWSABus smashes through man's house as
OL,4,Ahe watches TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has crashed into a man's house
OL,7,Fwhile he "was sitting watching telly",
OL,8,Finjuring him and his dog.
OL,10,FDavid Davidson said he "just heard the
OL,11,Fbang and the whole wall came in" when
OL,12,Fthe vehicle smashed through his home on
OL,13,FMary Street, close to Longtown Primary
OL,14,FSchool in Cumbria, shortly after 08:00
OL,15,FGMT on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
