OL,3,GNEWSABus smashes through man's house as
OL,4,Ahe watches TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavidson, who has lived in the house
OL,7,Fsince 1995 and was sporting a gashed
OL,8,Fhead after the crash, said debris fell
OL,9,Fon him and his dog Ivur. The
OL,10,F12-year-old terrier was dug out from
OL,11,Fthe rubble and taken to a vet for
OL,12,Fchecks.
OL,14,FA woman in her 30s and a man in his 40s
OL,15,Fhave been arrested. Police say they
OL,16,Fwere in a car suspected of crashing
OL,17,Finto the Stagecoach bus prior to it
OL,18,Fhitting the house.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
